' @test valid
' @role test
' @status stable
' @dialect en-standard
' @covers Op.Send, Mod.Await, Mod.For, Op.Wait
' @description SEND with AWAIT ANY — wait for at least one reply

ACTORS expert

SEND question
  FOR @expert
  AWAIT ANY
  TIMEOUT 10m
  <<
  What is the root cause of the outage?
  >>
END

WAIT
  ON ?question
END

EXIT
